  "briefing": "Halcyon Group holds Patagonia through its water works. Download the records from the vault server, take down the site warden, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Patagonia Vault Job: Halcyon Group runs Patagonia from its water works, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to download the records, silence the warden and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Patagonia wakes up with the water works in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Patagonia before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
